; Print the name of an actor
;
; A is an actor id as kept in Subject ($B6EA): $FF means nobody known and
; prints the word "someone"; any other id (0 is the player, who prints as
; "you") is a character or object whose name phrase is printed by #R$73D6, with
; or without an article as PhraseMode ($B703) says. Used by the message
; control codes 6 and 16.
;
; A Actor id, NO_ACTOR for "someone"
@label=PrintActorName
@isub=CP NO_ACTOR
c$7488 CP $FF        ;
 $748A JP NZ,$73D6   ; PrintNameOfObject
@isub=LD DE,WORD_SOMEONE
 $748D LD DE,$0AE3   ; "someone"
 $7490 JP $74C1      ; PrintWord
